<img width="2128" height="439" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20eb459c-9803-45a2-b30e-5d1177d60a8d" />


### Impact:

-    Misdelivery / Data leakage: Email is sent to psres.net instead of test.com.

